==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Meals are a type of [[Food]] that can be made by [[Cooking]] [[Material]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]]. Several characters also give Meals to [[Link]] as a reward for saving them from [[Enemy|Enemies]]. As a result of their ingredients, Meals can be imbued with [[Added Effect]]s that provide bonuses to Link.

